    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I just wanted to say you have hit an absolute home run on `mini.files`\r\n\r\nI have tried every oil-style plugin under the sun. The way you architected the very slim/lean windows that overlay at the top left is just *so freaking useable* and perfect.\r\n\r\nThe gap between you (#1) and 2nd place file explorer plugins is massive, worlds ahead.\r\n\r\nI used to attempt to do all file editing in neotree but this just absolutely crushes\r\n\r\nThank you!!!\r\n\r\nIm trying to think of what else would make it even better and TBH i feel like it does everything. ",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I just wanted to say you have hit an absolute home run on <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.files</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I have tried every oil-style plugin under the sun. The way you architected the very slim/lean windows that overlay at the top left is just <em>so freaking useable</em> and perfect.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The gap between you (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1025823980\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/pull/1/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/pull/1\">#1</a>) and 2nd place file explorer plugins is massive, worlds ahead.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I used to attempt to do all file editing in neotree but this just absolutely crushes</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thank you!!!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Im trying to think of what else would make it even better and TBH i feel like it does everything.</p>",
    "bodyText": "I just wanted to say you have hit an absolute home run on mini.files\nI have tried every oil-style plugin under the sun. The way you architected the very slim/lean windows that overlay at the top left is just so freaking useable and perfect.\nThe gap between you (#1) and 2nd place file explorer plugins is massive, worlds ahead.\nI used to attempt to do all file editing in neotree but this just absolutely crushes\nThank you!!!\nIm trying to think of what else would make it even better and TBH i feel like it does everything.",
